  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag /USMC Eagle, Globe, &amp; Anchor Concealed Carry Hoodie offers comfort and concealment of your waistband carry weapon with a pass-through kangaroo pocket, all while supporting the United States Marine Corps.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133230",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag /USMC Eagle, Globe, &amp; Anchor Concealed Carry Hoodie offers comfort and concealment of your waistband carry weapon with a pass-through kangaroo pocket, all while supporting the United States Marine Corps. The USMC globe &amp; anchor with a split view of the U.S. flag is showcased across this concealed carry hoodie's chest, and a reverse orientation United States flag is printed on the right sleeve of this concealed carry sweatshirt. Quickly access your firearm through a pass-through kangaroo pocket design; the firearm access point under the kangaroo pocket for waistband carry draw measures 8.25 inches. This high-performance USMC sweatshirt&rsquo;s moisture wicking composition is designed to keep you cool and dry. The left sleeve includes two 6 inch pen pockets and a 4.5 inch x 4.5 inch zippered pocket with wire pass through port, while the right sleeve of features a 4.5 inch x 4.5 inch zippered pocket and a 4 inch x 4 inch look field ideal for attaching morale or flag patches. The thumb holes on this concealed carry wear prevent sleeves from riding up. This concealed carry hoodie is officially licensed by the United States Marine Corps.&nbsp;</p>",
